{#- EMPTY_FILE - ingestion: zero-byte attachment -#}
{% block subject %}We could not read your attachment: the file was empty{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The file attached to your message contains no data at all; its size is
zero bytes. This usually happens when a file is attached before it has
finished saving, or when the upload stops part way.{% endblock %}
